t love – they also need <strong>good food</strong> and a <strong>cozy home</strong>. With the money you earn from selling your rabbits, you can <strong>buy different houses</strong>, <strong>upgrade them</strong>, and even <strong>expand your meadow</strong>!<br>But be prepared… winter is coming – are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.poster.avif?t=1775583162\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.webm?t=1775583162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.mp4?t=1775583162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>ultra-rare alleles</strong> across <strong>eight rarity levels</strong> in your bred rabbits, and learn more about the <strong>real principles of inheritance</strong> through the in-game book.<br>With the <strong>“1 month = 1 game round”</strong> system, you decide how much time you want to spend with your rabbits each month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to <strong>breed the rarest rabbits</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.poster.avif?t=1775583162\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.webm?t=1775583162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp